ach thumbnail carries the same band on its top edge and the identity name\nunder the title. The overview gets one more key: ",["strong",0,"Super+0–4"]," filters the\noverview to one identity's windows, for \"show me everything work\"."],"\n",["h3",{"id":"clipboard-across-identities"},"Clipboard across identities"],"\n",["p",0,["code",0,"apps/wm/clipboard.odin"]," owns the selection. Proposed: the wm records which\nidentity the selection was copied from. Pasting into a window of a ",["em",0,"different"],"\nidentity shows a small inline banner the first time in a session: \"Paste from\nNorthwind into Personal? [Paste once] [Always for this pair today]\". Text with\nno identity, from a terminal for example, pastes freely. This is a ",["strong",0,"carry"],"\nfor the clipboard (",["code",0,"product.md"]," §5), and the carry log records it with a\ncontent hash, not the content."],"\n",["h3",{"id":"notifications"},"Notifications"],"\n",["p",0,"A toast carries the identity label (",["code",0,"●  Northwind"],") before the sender. A quiet\nidentity's notifications go to its digest and never to a toast. Each\nnotification is delivered to one device (",["code",0,"product.md"]," §8), so the wm needs to\nknow whether this device is the one being used. Input in the last 60 seconds\nis enough."],"\n",["hr",0],"\n",["h2",{"id":"2-the-greeter-and-the-lock-screen"},"2. The greeter and the lock screen"],"\n",["p",0,"The greeter signs in the ",["strong",0,"person"]," (the Palmy account), not an identity.\nProposed changes to ",["code",0,"apps/greeter"],":"],"\n",["pre",{"class":["shiki","shiki-themes","github-light","github-dark","sk-25qmca"],"tabindex":"0","data-lang":"text"},["code",0,["span",{"class":"line"},["span",{"class":"sk-wvjl67"},"            ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐"]],"\n",["span",{"class":"line"},["span",{"class":"sk-wvjl67"},"            │                 (CR)                        │"]],"\n",["span",{"class":"line"},["span",{"class":"sk-wvjl67"}," 